          "id": "65eefc63-f467-40e5-a71a-8843d72505c7",
          "memory": "User and Maya planned a pizza lunch catch-up at Rosa's on Oak Street on Friday, September 18, 2026 at 1 pm after not catching up properly for too long. Maya will be working from home and walk over, while User will be in the office but slip out for lunch for about an hour to an hour and a half.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "87728607-d24c-4341-a098-81b7c9aee5e7",
          "memory": "User loves Rosa's on Oak Street and agrees with Maya that the garlic knots are dangerous because User always eats too many. For the visit User is craving pizza and plans to get a side salad with knots for balance, while Maya is craving pepperoni. User noted Rosa's redid the patio with way more tables and less wobbly chairs.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1085c54-b5c8-451e-ad77-e325141aeeab",
          "memory": "User is taking a pottery class with week 3 scheduled for the night of September 16, 2026. User describes it as messy but fun with a lopsided bowl, noting the teacher says that is the charm and that the Tuesday instructor is super chill.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "3d667573-36cd-41c7-beae-adff8da92ea1",
          "memory": "Maya's sister wants to join a pottery class and Maya said she will send her User's studio after User encouraged it and recommended the Tuesday instructor.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "78574c86-fade-45b2-a89f-2a3a379385de",
          "memory": "On September 15, 2026 User stayed about 20 minutes late at work and said it took forever to get out of the parking lot. User had a sad desk salad for lunch that day, while Maya heated up leftover veggie stir fry from September 14 that was still pretty good.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "5ddedfb9-7413-4fc6-b614-1ace4e836c48",
          "memory": "As of September 15, 2026 User needs to water houseplants because they are dying, and Maya's basil plant already gave up, with Maya joking it will be resurrected from the grocery store.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
